Description: Upstream changes introduced in version 0.3.92-0ubuntu3
 This patch has been created by dpkg-source during the package build.
 Here's the last changelog entry, hopefully it gives details on why
 those changes were made:
 .
 indicator-messages (0.3.92-0ubuntu3) natty; urgency=low
 .
   * debian/patches/lp_690668.patch
     - Memory leak fixes (LP: #690668)
   * debian/control
     - Bump standards version to 3.9.1
   * debian/source/format
     - Use source format 3.0 (quilt)
 .
 The person named in the Author field signed this changelog entry.
Author: Ken VanDine <ken.vandine@canonical.com>
Bug-Ubuntu: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/690668

